      en: ["The highest elevation in the region is approximately 500 meters above sea level.", "Sikasso receives over 1,300 millimeters of rainfall annually, which is exceptionally high for Mali.", "The Mamelon hill in the city center once served as a lookout point for the Kings of Sikasso.", "The region is Mali's primary producer of both tea and potatoes.", "Prehistoric rock paintings have been discovered in the nearby caves of Missirikoro.", "The Lotio River originates in the mountains located to the south of the city."],
